-- P81：创建 OWNER + CHILD 后改 CHILD 的 NAME。created 元素不进生产属性变更记录；
-- 预期仍是一个 new root，datacenter 层不应出现 CHILD 的 renamed/attribute 记录。
ALPHA LOG "{{LOG_PATH}}" OVER
$P AMS-R3-P81-APPLY-ALIVE
{{WORLD_ANCHOR}}
{{TARGET_NAME}}-Z
NEW EQUIPMENT {{TARGET_NAME}}-OWNER
POS E 41000 N 5000 U 0
Q REF
Q NAME
NEW BOX XLEN 1000 YLEN 600 ZLEN 400
NAME {{TARGET_NAME}}-CHILD
POS E 500 N 0 U 0
Q REF
Q NAME
Q OWNE
{{TARGET_NAME}}-CHILD
Q REF
Q NAME
NAME {{TARGET_NAME}}-CHILD-RENAMED
Q NAME
{{TARGET_NAME}}-OWNER
Q MEMB
SAVEWORK 'AMS round3 P81 created ancestor attribute'
$P AMS-R3-P81-APPLY-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
